{"id":54353,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=54353"},"modified":"2026-10-19T12:48:02","modified_gmt":"2026-10-19T11:48:02","slug":"6-cascatas-trail-running","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/6-cascatas-trail-running\/","title":{"rendered":"6 Cascatas Trail Running 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">6 Cascatas Trail Running 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>6 Cascatas Trail Running 2026<\/strong> (6\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>29 de novembro de 2026<\/strong>, na hist\u00f3rica aldeia de <strong>Cheleiros<\/strong>, concelho de Mafra (distrito de Lisboa). Organizado pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva Trail4U<\/strong> e integrado como segunda etapa oficial do circuito <strong>Merrell Trail Running Series 2026\/27<\/strong>, o evento tem centro nevr\u00e1lgico, partida e meta instalados no Largo da Igreja de Cheleiros.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Intitulada como uma verdadeira prova de inverno, a competi\u00e7\u00e3o percorre vales encaixados, trilhos rurais, linhas de \u00e1gua e cascatas naturais da regi\u00e3o saloia. O programa divide-se em tr\u00eas dist\u00e2ncias distintas, limitadas a um total conjunto de 600 participantes: o <strong>Trail Longo K24<\/strong> (aproximadamente 24 km e 1.000 m D+) e o <strong>Trail Curto K13<\/strong> (cerca de 13 km e 600 m D+), ambos com tiro de partida \u00e0s 09:00 e tempo limite de 6 horas, seguidos pela <strong>Caminhada de 11 km<\/strong> (n\u00e3o competitiva) \u00e0s 09:05.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">As provas competitivas contam com o desafio especial de velocidade em subida <strong>Merrell Power Zone<\/strong> (segmento cronometrado via Strava premiado com voucher de 50\u20ac em material desportivo), al\u00e9m de pr\u00e9mios em vouchers (150\u20ac, 80\u20ac e 40\u20ac) para os p\u00f3dios da geral masculina e feminina, trof\u00e9us para os 3 primeiros de cada escal\u00e3o et\u00e1rio (Sub-23 a Veteranos 70+) e para as 3 melhores equipas. O evento decorre em regime de semi-autossufici\u00eancia ambiental \u2014 sem copos descart\u00e1veis nos postos de abastecimento \u2014 e encerra as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es a 22 de novembro de 2026. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">29 de Novembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Largo da Igreja de Cheleiros, Mafra, Lisboa<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" 